OL,5,G0000 Bangers & Cash
OL,6,     FE-type/LC3 Truck/Morris 8/Mini
OL,7,     FVan: Derek is off to Bridlington
OL,8,     Fto pick-up a trio of classics: a
OL,9,     FMorris 8 tourer, a Mini Van and a
OL,10,     F1940s Morris LC3 truck.
OL,11,G0100 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,12,     FIn Wiltshire Henry and Simon meet
OL,13,     FLaura who lives in a collection of
OL,14,     Ffarm buildings. Henry takes a hay
OL,15,     Fcart and Simon falls in love with
OL,16,     Fsome glass collecting jars.
